#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/mark-channels-unread.rst:7
msgid ""
"If you read messages in a channel, but don't have time to address them "
"right away, you can mark that channel as unread. Hover over the channel "
"name in the channel sidebar, select the **More** |more-icon-vertical| "
"option, then select **Mark as Unread**."
msgstr ""

